window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Rediscover the magic of the final book of The Falconer Trilogy—now reimagined for adult romantasy fans with new spicy content!</b></p> <p><b>Set in Victorian-era Scotland, this historical romantasy adventure will sweep you away</b></p> <p><b><i>Rise from the ashes. Rewrite fate. End the war.</i></b></p> <p>The dead don't stay buried. Not when ancient magic is involved.</p> <p>Aileana Kameron claws free from her grave to find the world unraveling.</p> <p>Tick tock. The clock's winding down.</p> <p>Only one relic can hold back the tide of destruction, a book hidden deep in hostile fae territory. Guarded by the Morrigan, the oldest, deadliest creature in existence.</p> <p>Aileana has one chance to save humanity and the fae she loves: Kiaran MacKay, once her consort, now a king damned to insatiable hunger. As they fight their way through a dangerous realm, their bond will be pushed to the breaking point.</p> <p>This is no fairytale quest. It's life or death, with the fate of their worlds in the balance. If they fail, it's over.</p> <p>Their lives. The realms.</p> <p>Everything.</p>"; 
